  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Slice apple into thin strips. Cut firm tofu (see ingredients) into 2cm cubes.\n• In a large bowl, combine tofu and Asian BBQ seasoning.\n• In a small bowl, combine sweet chilli sauce, sesame seeds and a splash of water.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/693f88a91101204cae75192d/step-9b9f4800.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Heat a large frying pan over medium-high heat with a drizzle of olive oil.\n• When oil is hot, cook tofu in batches for best result, turning until browned, 3-4 mins.\n• Remove from heat then add sweet chilli sauce mixture, tossing to coat. Season to taste.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/693f88a91101204cae75192d/step-7b0a4810.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, combine slaw mix and apple in a large bowl. Add a drizzle of olive oil and vinegar and toss to coat. Season.\n• Microwave mini flour tortillas on a microwave-safe plate in 10 second bursts until warmed through.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/693f88a91101204cae75192d/step-bed8e620.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Build tacos by spreading mayonnaise over tortillas then filling with slaw and tofu to serve.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/693f88a91101204cae75192d/step-3756fe30.jpeg"
    }
  ]
